iz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/o50ZEWzkxRwsNbHL9Eia9uncIgoNAsYoYjltJ9lGgKkqYIWhPhL5G01L4whXJeUgDwHylHaHRP00XFdUaNhnCiaiaAs4bGzqlThK3iboI7KYELo/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2026 年 8 月 27 日 —8 月 30 日（4天3夜,本次活动不收取培训费，学员往返车票和食宿自理）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/o50ZEWzkxRxbpbOFSa3ZaNluJIgVh9rBXsicv9eLDlIbqyOSLaRksfrdB7sm4x2MH5rX0JWpTYTHgaSNeNMe1PvetxvptVphTJPbkKAp4piac/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>三、举办地点</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/o50ZEWzkxRyibEeOUXJS9icg6oQ5IKSotnzNWEXUutO7kxWEXDib8ibWwiaGMWBgWUSATyDOxuYB2SxhHoqn2xqSbAI6bXSXULXvaOwN51bIjdW8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>江西中医药大学（湾里校区)</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/o50ZEWzkxRxIhQsAP09CQibMu2lyF8eKHticJFn6HbFMQfPwONibibugvicpymhKOZAJAia9zlSw2FwX0a6e7kPUjL6k3nHWW407iaQiaJEwXicJCMbY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>四、招募规模</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/o50ZEWzkxRwPNuzibqiclBrcaBEqmmibl2bvSnwhsGXI11cKVDgTfvibESazUVVmY48DJMWJ2FdZ6LicaJ4ZlluhYF2rm4KrsqMibGvJ4IS0rLJ0s/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2026 年 8 月 27 日 —8 月 30 日（4天3夜,本次活动不收取培训费，学员往返车票和食宿自理）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loadi